# Ownership philosophy:
# - Every area always has exactly 3 engineer owners — reviews aren't blocked by
#   one person's absence, and the burden is split evenly across the team.
# - Testing and Core get our most experienced engineers, since both are
#   critical for stability. Other areas mix skill levels on purpose, to spread
#   knowledge and ramp people up. Revisit and reassign periodically.
# - The whole team stays as fallback owner: if an area turns out to be
#   uncovered or misassigned, fix it as we go.
# - Admins can always approve and override CODEOWNERS if all 3 owners of an
#   area are out of office.
# - Anyone can comment on any PR or request a specific reviewer, regardless of
#   ownership; in a technical disagreement, the area's CODEOWNERS decide.
#
# TODO: every line below still points at the placeholder team; left on purpose
# to review the area split first, before filling in actual per-area owners.

